Hardware-free regression tests live here.

The VS Code "Test Gyerek_jatek (no hardware)" task runs tools/run_tests.py.
It executes Python project/configuration checks, compiles the real portable
C++ game/music/LCD modules, then runs native/test_main.cpp on the host.
These are host tests, not an Arduino upload or PlatformIO serial test run.

See the root README.md for compiler setup, coverage and hardware limitations.
